Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:04.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:07.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:10.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:13.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:15.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 怎么回事啊？Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就只有闪得快吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:23.02,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:27.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趁它离远了 大家快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:30.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:37.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:41.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没受伤吧？好了 快跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:46.70,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Prism！人们都去避难了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:48.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:51.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1055)}哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1372,1055)}哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:55.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.91,0:00:59.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:00.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:04.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:06.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飞翼冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:06.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:13.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.88,0:01:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔镜平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:28.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:40.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:43.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢了 赢了！不愧是Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:44.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！那边那个看戏的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:52.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,话要说清楚 我可还没有认真起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死鸭子嘴硬可是很逊的哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:57.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:59.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就你这个不参加战斗的旁观者...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们做好准备 下次送你们上路！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:03.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了 你这样子好逊的...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的是没错啦 我只是个局外人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有这回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:13.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没有这回事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶是我们重要的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:20.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都支援着我们 我们才能努力战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:22.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主也很喜欢姐姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:24.66,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,稀饭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:26.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我也要加把劲！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:31.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的 我终于要开始去幼儿园实习了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 现在就已经期待得不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:43.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶 加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要神采飞扬地上了哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}振翅飞扬！最强的保育员 Cure Butterfly!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(1335,980)}蝴蝶愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1330,523)}{\fs50}天窗市幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友们 来介绍一下新老师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面 我叫圣蝶华！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然还是个实习老师 不过我的目标可是最强的保育员！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多多关照！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说最强诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好帅啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最强的是Precure啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道Precure吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是和邪恶的怪兽战斗 非常厉害的英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很帅的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:12.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在河边受到过Cure Wing的帮助！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也想像Cure Wing那样变强！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！Wing肯定会很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识Precure吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？小蝶老师是Precure吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过是最强的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿巴巴巴巴巴巴...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该算是... 同伴吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情就是这样的 这里是幼儿园小朋友写的信！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:45.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:46.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,康康！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:49.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:54.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,咳咳！还是尽量不要议论我们比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们的真身暴露了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 你先来看看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:02.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢Cure Wing了\N\N（我要像你一样 成为最强的 ——健）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,心头一紧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健好像是Wing的大粉丝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:09.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,心头一颤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:13.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,回... 回信该什么时候写啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:17.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:24.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,毕... 毕竟不回信 有违骑士的礼仪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没错吧？公主
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:27.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,对哒！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白你们也能回信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,当然的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}当然的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了对了 实习期我就住这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经跟由由阿姨说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:40.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:42.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐也要住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:43.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就继续做实习的准备了 准备起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华很开心的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.15,0:06:53.41,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘎哦！怪兽来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:06:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不怕！飞翼愈卫拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪兽怎么可以不中招！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁让老师是最强的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最强的是Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.09,0:07:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿呦 好了 爽快了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大口大口地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对 很熟练呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友们 Precure给你们回信了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,努力成为最强吧 Cure Wing致
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟... 真是太满足了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.97,0:07:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶华老师！阿健他！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜呜呜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵架了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁让他不遵守次序 我就教训了他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 可是打人不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是要成为最强的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要像Precure那样 打击邪恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师认为啊 成为最强
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最需要的 并不是打倒别人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不对！我才是对的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶老师才不是最强的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:24.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那家幼儿园吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家是不是都很开心啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:30.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就悄悄地看一看 不要打扰到小蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:31.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,悄悄地！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 不要跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌 讨厌！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:41.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健？是他 就是那个时候的小朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:46.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟小蝶姐在玩抓鬼呢 小时候我常常玩的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:49.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 怎么好像很拼命的样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:52.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,抓鬼可是要真刀真枪一决胜负的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:57.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呵呵呵... 好了 该开始这场秀了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:11.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:14.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:15.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:26.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿健 不要离开我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:32.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 那边看戏的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:36.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你上次说我“死鸭子嘴硬”是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:39.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,正好这次观众多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:43.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要当着你和小鬼们的面 把Precure揍个开花
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:45.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们认清楚现实
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然就为了这种事...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:51.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你个看戏的 就闭上嘴默默地观赏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
